Only NOT DONE items. For completed tasks and fixed bugs, see `.docs/todo_done.md`.

> **Convention:** New entries are always added **at the end** of their type section.
> After adding an entry, **increment the tally** at the bottom of that section to keep the count accurate.
> The tally tracks: total count (open + done across both files). Used to correctly index the next entry when adding.
> **Feature TASKs** use one line linking to their folder: `` - **TASK-012** [P1] User authentication — `planned` 3/7 → .docs/tasks/TASK-012-user-auth/ ``
> Status moves `brainstorming` → `specced` → `planned` → `in-progress n/m` → `done`. Only `/dev_feature`, `/dev_plan`, `/dev_execute` change it.
> TASK numbers share the TASK tally with quick TASK entries — never restart numbering.

